-- WoW Forever: Alcaz Prison (map 2994, levels 48-55) trash, patrols and boss rooms laid out again on the real floor.
-- Every spawn here is HAND-PLACED: no sniff of this dungeon exists yet. When a sniff comes, replace this whole file
-- (guids 48120000-48120199, their formations and waypoint paths 481200000-481201999) with the sniffed spawns.
-- How it was built:
--  * the floor is the server's own navmesh for map 2994 (mmaps from our extractor); every creature stands on the walkable
--    mesh joined to the entrance, at the floor's height, about 1 yd or more from a wall (the old file had 23 of 82 in walls or
--    under the floor);
--  * which creature kinds stand in which part of the prison is kept from 2026_11_14_41 (Everlake's Forever dungeon
--    work, github.com/buildthehomelab, GPL, plus our guesses there);
--  * packs are linked (creature_formations groupAI 3) so a pack is pulled as one; patrols walk the main hall, the flooded
--    lower passage and the west hall ring;
--  * the bosses keep their spots (the bot route uses them); the fight scripts' helpers stand inside their call range:
--    3 hounds by Wrex, 2 enchantresses by Ca'zass, 2 chaplains by Katerina, 2 jailers by the Questioner;
--  * the quest kill counts are covered: 17 Strashaz Soldiers (15 needed), 10 Strashaz Enchantresses (8 needed).
-- Runs after 2026_11_14_41 and replaces its creature rows. Safe to run again.

DELETE FROM `creature_formations` WHERE `leaderGUID` BETWEEN 48120000 AND 48120199 OR `memberGUID` BETWEEN 48120000 AND 48120199;
